[{"title":"盱眙道上","author":"李寄","text":"皇皇同贾客，百里倦人征。\n乱水妨人渡，荒田便马行。\n柳争春日态，雁去北方声。\n遥问山前垒，今知第一城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21236,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀古","author":"李寄","text":"畴昔读南史，实壮盱眙城。\n佛狸百万师，饮马长江滨。\n两淮无立草，何况兖与青。\n玄漠弃军走，义恭议南奔。\n盱眙弹丸地，气足吞虏人。\n臧质固勇悍，沈璞何英英。\n封溲怒致敌，杀尸与城平。\n三旬锐尽退，中国威始伸。\n夕阳登南岭，山腰垒星星。\n如环连复断，心疑城郭形。\n鞭视询父老，果云古城根。\n人和固第一，地利亦非轻。\n如此据高险，兵士有所凭。\n所以虏势众，仰攻势不能。\n土山既难栖，冲车颓数升。\n不然虏百万，肉薄何难登。\n忠如常山守，竟遭禄山烹。\n思政守长社，终于城溃奔。\n人地两相济，负隅虎敢撄。\n我昔长淮来，县在山之阴。\n惊讶卑散甚，今始豁心情。\n于兹知古人，形胜咫尺争。\n奈何无远谋，自撤金陵屏。\n有险不肯踞，坐令寇纵横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21237,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟发旧县雨泊复行","author":"李寄","text":"二月淮水绿，兹游喜再逢。\n半帆风力稳，群树雨声浓。\n鱼贱倾篮买，舟行起碇从。\n沧波相对浴，白鸟巧仪容。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21238,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚投双沟大雨","author":"李寄","text":"风帆开不远，瞑色入清淮。\n舟就渔灯泊，钟从燕市来。\n鼍鸣应夜雨，龙蛰待春雷。\n客睡难成梦，孤肠易九回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21239,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重次濠城","author":"李寄","text":"天意倾元运，黎民正倒悬。\n沛丰占王气，谯宋识星躔。\n云护真龙起，谋资一剑先。\n剪除狼虎尽，衽席孑遗全。\n洗足驱群勇，张罗服众贤。\n岂知尘扰扰，早已念惓惓。\n日月光辉始，山河洗濯然。\n偏安闻蜀汉，薄伐待周宣。\n鼎卜东都日，期踰入百年。\n再浮淮泗棹，目断古城边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21240,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"淮岸无仙树，惟杨柳种皆成行，一林千百株，堆云泻浪，绿映水天，而长河卫北岸倍多，因口占一绝","author":"李寄","text":"茅檐土屋黄沙岸，门对清淮不次开。\n领略春风无限好，一林杨柳绿云堆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21241,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟行望荆山","author":"李寄","text":"舟前雨暗接天遥，不见荆山意寂寥。\n猎猎风将云幕捲，故人天外手相招。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21242,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"护城野步","author":"李寄","text":"芳草城隅路，羁怀散漫行。\n走坡黄犊健，掷水白鲦轻。\n孑孑游成懒，昏昏酒欲倾。\n转风晴可必，差慰道途情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21243,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鄢陵道中","author":"李寄","text":"朝暾媚平陆，一路草新齐。\n村犬追驴吠，林禽背客啼。\n此行真草草，无事亦栖栖。\n为有男儿志，征尘尽日迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21244,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"抉沟道中","author":"李寄","text":"孤客无聊赖，良辰尚旅征。\n闻禽能发兴，见柳亦牵情。\n铎急车归市，犁轻犊耦耕。\n谁怜好风日，驴背过清明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21245,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"许昌道中","author":"李寄","text":"春风难慰此飘蓬，路入中州处处同。\n旅麦野棠荒集上，马铃车铎滚尘中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21246,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"颖桥","author":"李寄","text":"古集荒如此，行人过亦哀。\n春风如不及，桃李一时开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21247,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过汝州西四十里，自此皆山驿骑行，山上漫成","author":"李寄","text":"缓辔宽缰过坦途，高高下下乱山初。\n句成最恨蹄前失，惊破诗魂是蹇驴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21248,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自内埠渡伊水至辛店三十里，其閒崖壑甚佳","author":"李寄","text":"地僻春能透，落花香满衣。\n渡桥因涧石，开店倚山厓。\n下走宽驴力，谋沽散客怀。\n鸣禽如报我，此地可茅斋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21249,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行次白杨镇登观音阁","author":"李寄","text":"征鞍才解便登台，旬日尘襟此顿开。\n细麦层层青作浪，浮云滚滚白成堆。\n山晴树色如相见，风逆花香不肯来。\n多谢黄鹂能鼓吹，诗肠瘦尽句还裁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21250,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行望孔城村","author":"李寄","text":"山村景佳绝，揽辔为迟迟。\n矮矮隐茅屋，高高出酒旗。\n枝风非杨柳，树雪是棠梨。\n驴背人遥羡，村中自不知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21251,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"经熊耳山","author":"李寄","text":"熊耳峰何壮，诸山拥一尊。\n高将中岳并，远见三秦门。\n驴背风多大，衣前云可扪。\n纷纷罗列者，看去是儿孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21252,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早发","author":"李寄","text":"行客啸俦侣，征衣颠倒从。\n跑分官道月，同听远鸡风。\n领路骡鸣铎，护行人插弓。\n昨传谁早发，肉已饱毛虫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21253,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道上口占","author":"李寄","text":"暂憩征鞍道路中，世閒公道是春风。\n破垣废井苍苔合，无主桃花分外红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21254,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"经函谷关","author":"李寄","text":"孤吟驴背逐纷纷，路簇征蹄乱晓云。\n百二关中曾未险，五千言后竟无人。\n遥遥山去连秦岭，滚滚尘飞及鸟群。\n却笑弃繻非壮志，高车驷马了终军。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21255,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潼关","author":"李寄","text":"群雉连云起，雄关扼九州。\n罴当函谷道，虎踞大河流。\n有舌供长啸，无家成壮游。\n谁知驴背上，衣白傲王侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21256,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潼关","author":"李寄","text":"滚滚白云压驴背，鞭指关城在云内。\n连山万里倒捲回，黄河天上奔腾会。\n春风城上捲红旗，桃花无主出城飞。\n城边老人自叹息，贼破城空燕语稀。\n当时十万貔貅卒，大将桓桓柏与日。\n请缨慷慨祖金吾，厉齿磨牙思嚼贼。\n一锋数骑未叩门，督师先渡夏阳奔。\n借问归人督师谁，传庭其名姓是孙。\n可怜千里金城地，拱手授受而已矣。\n既据长山天下头，席捲燕京势披靡。\n君亡臣走社稷墟，祖始秦关各处逋。\n壮哉百二之天险，屹屹当关无一夫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21257,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"华州道中","author":"李寄","text":"青麦油油秀白芒，畛边赤日震沙黄。\n慇勤送客东风里，驿路杨花分外忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21258,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"经骊山","author":"李寄","text":"闻说高楼夹路遮，楼头酒旆驻行车。\n如今鞭指笙歌地，蔓草斜阳无一家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21259,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病馀杂咏感怀初入永兴二首 其一","author":"李寄","text":"破褐空囊竟入秦，南山北渭望中新。\n澄天柹叶妆成晦，捲地杨花送去春。\n皂帽管宁非避世，白衣李泌是山人。\n竦肩袖手行吟日，驰逐纷纷看雁臣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21260,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病馀杂咏感怀初入永兴二首 其二","author":"李寄","text":"胡家羌笛满春风，百二山河感昔雄。\n滚滚腥尘烘日黑，炎炎虐焰射云红。\n钱囊羞涩诗看好，病体登临屐累同。\n时在苏君言不敢，且将仪舌捲喉中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21261,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灞桥即事","author":"李寄","text":"孤剑游秦日，长吟托与时。\n山人唐李泌，酒客晋王尼。\n沧海何其横，银章未可期。\n云山与匹马，一一入新诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21262,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登西五台","author":"李寄","text":"座外高台鸟外楼，登临白眼看神州。\n渭城春满人皆绿，太乙云生山欲浮。\n无地可为百姓哭，此天定要杞人忧。\n酒楼诗草吾侪事，百首千钟未肯休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21263,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客居","author":"李寄","text":"非唐非汉我游秦，整日高眠懒向人。\n何处燕来同作客，故乡月到自相亲。\n孤身咤走三千里，多病悲看九十春。\n沧海横流何日静，徐书马疏好披陈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21264,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"閒居","author":"李寄","text":"锦葵树树开皆好，木槿朝朝色可怜。\n径蝶蕊香俱散乱，近人花朵更鲜妍。\n虫丝罥蕊何无赖，蜂嘴噙香便落魂。\n整日花前勤打点，抚摩佳树作儿孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21265,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观蜜蜂采花","author":"李寄","text":"群蜂矜苦采，一日几回来。\n性泼香浪藉，声喧蝶避开。\n花花更互入，股股再三堆。\n毕竟他人用，徒然竭尔才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21266,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初闻蝉次崔闇修韵","author":"李寄","text":"去夏寥天阁，终朝傍我鸣。\n如何数千里，又送两三声。\n乍响音能妙，忽闻心一清。\n物情殊自惜，客耳不曾盈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21267,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"木槿","author":"李寄","text":"六月荷花好，如兹槿亦强。\n可怜千瓣艳，不过一朝香。\n似悟人荣落，偏供僧糗粮。\n寄余周子爱，红白足相当。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21268,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"徐步","author":"李寄","text":"高卧兼徐步，空斋日日同。\n柘喧争果雀，椿袅挂丝虫。\n阮屐喜无累，杜囊怪底空。\n花前且饱食，静看槿口红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21269,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"署中有怀终南","author":"李寄","text":"饱食空斋懒过人，花閒树下百回巡。\n枝枝叶绿风翻背，个个蜂黄粉裹身。\n游借山图供睡览，诗凭药力助心神。\n三千里外吾能到，咫尺终南隔却秦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21270,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"李寄","text":"独坐一庭空，凉生夜不同。\n鸟归风谡谡，树转月悤悤。\n影到三更后，鳌潜万籁中。\n怪来清到骨，积水浸吾躬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21271,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"睡起有感","author":"李寄","text":"枕上白日过，梦中生事空。\n初完严老局，正遇羲皇风。\n山雨欲来黑，火云犹对红。\n如闻南亩叹，喝死供租庸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21272,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋后十日夜坐","author":"李寄","text":"便觉秋无赖，偏怜雨及晨。\n数虫声对客，一叶落惊人。\n药力图心睡，□□报句新。\n诗成吟且笑，我有笔端春。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21273,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦故乡","author":"李寄","text":"客舍惊闻雁，秋宵恐漏长。\n故乡原是自，归梦亦凄凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21274,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜雨坐","author":"李寄","text":"夜雨难为客，秋虫厌杀人。\n孤灯一夜坐，白发数茎新。\n游偶闻琴附，贫非为热因。\n故山书卷在，重理钓鱼缗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21275,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卧病思避终南","author":"李寄","text":"昏昏欲眠眠不定，唧唧孤吟吟不称。\n作伴空烦月照人，良方无过山医病。\n抛书投枕著游屐，门锁春风当罗薜。\n人情怜蝶舞来疏，客气山禽飞去疾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21276,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜月","author":"李寄","text":"明月来何处，秋天色更佳。\n空庭十丈水，树影一团花。\n留恋孤吟客，惊翻乱叫鸦。\n天涯终夕走，岂尔亦无家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21277,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又","author":"李寄","text":"明月天涯若比邻，清秋一见一番新。\n夜深最爱空庭树，瘦影离披似醉人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21278,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望远","author":"李寄","text":"滚滚悲秋客，凄凄苦病身。\n登临见天地，怀抱向何人。\n云暗南山树，风连北地尘。\n英雄今不见，搔首问三秦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21279,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜","author":"李寄","text":"独酒三杯可禦寒，不妨长坐到更阑。\n雁声初向霜前听，月色偏宜树里看。\n久客自知容易老，无家莫叹路行难。\n秋风此夕殊多事，送过箜篌簇几弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21280,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋声","author":"李寄","text":"秋声一片起，客绪又如何。\n我是无家者，思乡亦浩歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21281,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜","author":"李寄","text":"加衣檐际坐，零露酿霜华。\n客病诗为祟，天涯月一家。\n顽童扇铁马，邻笛应胡笳。\n赖此消清夜，羁人免叹嗟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21282,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日","author":"李寄","text":"百二关中重九日，三千里外一孤身。\n登山临水归何处，对酒放歌愁杀人。\n青天皛皛雁独去，黄菊丛丛花自新。\n秦地秋风尤凛洌，难为客子泪沾巾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21283,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独步","author":"李寄","text":"独步空庭月，寒生积水中。\n閒人难有两，我影亦能同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21284,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋尽","author":"李寄","text":"旅邸惊秋尽，绨袍又乞怜。\n低头趋矮屋，大笑向高天。\n雁过风凄切，云横岚接连。\n客心愁绝处，吟倚井梧边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21285,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自遣","author":"李寄","text":"西风撼庭木，秋晚客心惊。\n老叶不肯下，群鸦何故鸣。\n自吟无限韵，寄食免劳生。\n多少乘舆者，传呼夜亦行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21286,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹌鹑篇","author":"李寄","text":"有隼逐鹌鹑，皇回见人投。\n两翩塌地飞，拍拍如有求。\n主人顿起怜，手援置案头。\n为之许长久，即向僮仆谋。\n先有鹦鹉鸟，鸟去笼在否。\n其笼颇宽敞，堤防事事周。\n谅无狐狸患，鹰鹘眼敢偷。\n安顿使得所，于我心无忧。\n胡为忽僵仆，转侧向两眸。\n羽毛蹙一片，细腿如茧抽。\n伤哉胆惊破，痛定魂难收。\n剪纸招其归，书符骗其雠。\n炬火熨其体，温汤暖其喉。\n腹伸渐趯趯，抖擞何赳赳。\n悍气欲赴斗，老拳应无俦。\n悬之廊檐下，群雀远啾啾。\n明日复来视，头破血迸流。\n往来满笼撞，思飞无时休。\n诫以勿复尔，斯笼可优游。\n外物既不干，饮啄免力搜。\n粲粲白粱粟，涓涓泉满瓯。\n向者浪跳跃，几几饱鸺鹠。\n今胡不少慰，留滞胜戈矛。\n物性卒难改，放之无怨尤。\n为谢敝笼窄，任尔天衢游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21287,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶占","author":"李寄","text":"秦月何其白，秦风分外秋。\n主人原是客，应念敝貂裘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21288,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"屡游终南不果志恨","author":"李寄","text":"如今咄咄要书空，门外终南隔万重。\n自笑秦游真怪事，区区一饭缚元龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21289,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仲冬出永兴，赴池阳微雪十里而霁马上漫成","author":"李寄","text":"散雪咸阳道，霏霏映薄暾。\n红毡驴背客，青幔酒家村。\n瘦马随人后，寒风口泪痕。\n南山吐霁色，苍翠送行轩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21290,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"池阳咏雪次东坡诗韵二首 其一","author":"李寄","text":"漫天大雪催新句，可恼东坡下韵严。\n黄鹤诗佳应阁笔，葫芦样好也题盐。\n月明野水横孤艇，花满寒枝压矮檐。\n白玉合成兹世界，大观犹忆华峰尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21291,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"池阳咏雪次东坡诗韵二首 其二","author":"李寄","text":"剡水自弹安道曲，东郊难驾邵雍车。\n白当三腊占为麦，飞向长筵看是花。\n落落不因人便热，飘飘一似我无家。\n严寒绝少炉中炭，又向樽前两手叉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21292,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又池阳咏雪次东坡诗韵二首 其一","author":"李寄","text":"长空威发冻云黏，寒比金吾禁更严。\n词客漫誇梁苑赋，司农欲税谢家盐。\n杯浮琥珀羊酥酒，帽拥葳苏獭尾檐。\n要我开怀真痛饮，真须立马雪山尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21293,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又池阳咏雪次东坡诗韵二首 其二","author":"李寄","text":"寒林白尽晚归鸦，路有饥寒尚役车。\n可惜细非荞麦面，更怜朵似木棉花。\n有秋定自占来岁，公道何曾隔一家。\n檐下穷黎思曝背，愿为千丈拨云叉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21294,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仲春二日云阳野步","author":"李寄","text":"经岁长关客里门，东风特地上高原。\n黄鹂啼就鸠鸣树，白马嘶过犬吠村。\n天欲困人如不及，春还慰我似能言。\n花明柳暗盈盈女，消尽江南落拓春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21295,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"听雨同崔关修","author":"李寄","text":"为客厌长夜，雨声滴君心。\n君心何太苦，有梦到乡城。\n为语阶前雨，乡心我独轻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21296,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"池阳野步遣兴","author":"李寄","text":"鸾啼花乱好良辰，客里东风日日新。\n春色醉人无远近，不知今是异乡身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21297,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清明野步有感","author":"李寄","text":"春愁压客不知春，拭眼惊看此日新。\n树树桃花风著力，村村社酒鸟呼人。\n两年梦绕双亲墓，万里心伤一病身。\n怅望江南春十倍，敝裘何事苦留秦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21298,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日步东城李氏园戏为纤体","author":"李寄","text":"簇簇新花细细馨，满园春拥一伶仃。\n数过蝶影俄还乱，听去莺声却又停。\n孕絮杨花无力舞，移根药蕊几时醒。\n峨山点破思乡恨，幻作江南北固青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21299,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"出三原北门十五里曰桥头杏花竟十里走马一游漫成遣兴","author":"李寄","text":"飘零秦地无归客，走马看花红一色。\n十里锦霞烧碧天，如迎如却似飞仙。\n近看不及远看好，开满不及开半巧。\n凡花大抵尽当然，而杏尤宜如是观。\n樱桃正绽香盈蒂，欲开不开见花态。\n春风得意正佳时，迟来五日看残枝。\n下马独吟真解语，茗赏酒赏总无取。\n我闻今日曲江边，一枝不见惟寒烟。\n繁华一旦生荆棘，即如才士遭沦没。\n可怜如许杏花林，不照簪裾照野人。\n安知我在盛唐日，綵笔不占杏林春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":21300,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]